          "value": {
            "material": "综述开头及结尾对ICI疗效现状、耐药普遍性及综合治疗必要性的概述。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0362"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a8636d655e101ea640788bd4",
          "source_handle": "P0362",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "文中关于TIM-3, LAG-3, TIGIT, VISTA的作用机制及联合PD-1阻断剂的临床前和临床数据。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0362"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::937fa136e3bd71f711d32b1a",
          "source_handle": "P0362",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "关于TME中代谢物（乳酸、精氨酸、色氨酸代谢酶）及缺氧如何抑制CD8+ T细胞活化和增殖的段落。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0362"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4639ae6e7b962bd6cc4916a3",
          "source_handle": "P0362",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "主要侧重于菌群对整体免疫状态的宏观影响，未深入探讨特定菌种与特定ICI药物之间的精确分子互作机制。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道菌群作为免疫反应调节器的具体论述，指出健康菌群可增加效应T细胞水平、上调MHC-II并激活树突状细胞，而菌群失调可能导致治疗抵抗。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0362"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5bc5ad830818239b3eb7d189",
          "source_handle": "P0362",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制描述较为广泛，涵盖了多种肿瘤类型，未针对某一特定机制在所有实体瘤中的普遍性或特异性进行定量比较；部分机制间的因果关系多为相关性描述。",
            "contribution": "详细列出了介导效应的多重机制路径，包括：1) 肿瘤内在机制（TMB、抗原呈递、信号通路）；2) 微环境机制（抑制性细胞积累、细胞因子风暴、代谢抑制、缺氧）；3) 宿主机制（HLA限制、激素调节）。同时指出了克服这些机制的具体药物组合策略。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0362"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9eda1486a04b2f09ff269b77",
          "source_handle": "P0362",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述涵盖多种实体瘤，不同肿瘤类型的耐药机制和微生物组构成可能存在显著差异，应用时需考虑肿瘤特异性和情境依赖性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0362"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6d51902e6ac45ce0b92dc477",
          "source_handle": "P0362",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "文中引用的临床试验数据多为总体人群结果，未专门分层分析肠道菌群状态对疗效的影响，因此不能直接推断菌群与特定ICI疗效的因果强度。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0362"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::37a939282a533a5c7440a5ab",
          "source_handle": "P0362",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "关于宿主因素（如性别、HLA）的描述较为概括，需结合其他研究确认其在特定人群中的具体贡献度。",
