          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0364"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::62803cf1f35df9d793ad8b7d",
          "source_handle": "P0364",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "针对微生物群-ICI研究中分类学发现缺乏可重复性且结果不一致的问题，探讨这种不一致是否源于底层的功能趋同机制，并梳理该领域的研究演变、转化趋势及当前面临的挑战。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0364"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8d47f0eacec093dad5b4cb2a",
          "source_handle": "P0364",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肠道微生物群与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤治疗中的相互作用研究，时间跨度为2013年至2025年。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0364"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::47c662b783d3427c233a958e",
          "source_handle": "P0364",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该综述旨在解决肠道微生物群与ICI疗效关联研究中存在的分类学不一致性问题。作者通过整合Web of Science核心合集的文献计量学分析（2,195篇文献）和ClinicalTrials.gov的临床试验数据，结合对代表性临床及临床前研究的定性跨队列功能综合，探讨了微生物-ICI相互作用是否在共享免疫通路层面存在功能趋同。研究发现，尽管不同队列中响应相关的细菌物种差异显著，但功能上均指向短链脂肪酸产生、树突状细胞激活和CD8+ T细胞致敏等免疫调节通路。文章提出，分类学的变异可能反映了功能冗余而非生物学矛盾，并建议向基于功能的生物标志物和干预策略转变。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0364"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3e1984b3ca8b725e905ca262",
          "source_handle": "P0364",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅基于定性综合，未提供定量效应估计；主要涵盖黑色素瘤、NSCLC等实体瘤，但未详细区分所有亚型的具体差异。",
            "contribution": "提供了微生物群影响ICI疗效的临床证据图谱，指出响应者相关菌群虽物种各异，但均富集于免疫调节共生菌。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0364"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3b7a2ae7cc5b05daaa11d775",
          "source_handle": "P0364",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制解释主要基于文献回顾和概念框架，部分机制（如inosine的作用）主要来自临床前模型，其在人体中的确切贡献尚需更多验证；因果关系受限于观察性研究的混杂因素。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物-ICI相互作用的潜在机制，包括短链脂肪酸产生、树突状细胞成熟、Th1极化和CD8+ T细胞激活等通路。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::09453c46fe36046e2b9f48ff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
