        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7d8b043a7e1885793d80ee0b",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "研究设计采用横断面比较分析。首先，从22名接受ICI治疗的NSCLC和黑色素瘤患者及7名健康志愿者中收集粪便样本。其次，使用高通量培养组学技术（包括直接接种和富集培养，结合MALDI-TOF MS鉴定）分离细菌。同时，对部分NSCLC患者样本进行鸟枪法宏基因组测序。最后，通过统计检验（如Mann-Whitney检验、PERMANOVA、Chi-squared检验等）比较各组间的微生物组成、多样性和特定物种的富集情况，并分析培养组学与宏基因组结果的重叠与差异。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::59372e89d6fadb48d6a8f2c7",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了癌症患者与健康人之间肠道微生物组成的具体差异图谱，特别是通过培养组学验证了特定菌属（如Bifidobacterium, Bacteroides）在健康状态下的富集，以及Enterocloster等在癌症中的富集。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的机制验证实验，仅基于观察性数据提出假设。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b4f177e1ffefaafe67ae2a0e",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "证实了培养组学与宏基因组测序在表征肠道微生物组时的互补性，指出了宏基因组可能遗漏的特定物种。",
            "limits": "样本量较小（N=22患者，N=7健康对照），统计效力有限，可能导致校正后的p值不显著。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ce1489e7b71a95bc8ebb19ed",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "初步识别了与ICI治疗响应和非响应相关的特定细菌物种，为后续生物标志物开发提供候选列表。",
            "limits": "缺乏功能验证，且健康对照组年龄显著小于癌症组，年龄因素可能混淆结果，限制了结论的外推性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a8cc8cda624eadf3085dd174",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "癌症患者 vs. 健康志愿者 (HV)",
            "finding": "HV组的平均物种丰富度显著高于癌症组（34 vs. 18, p=0.002），且β多样性显示两组形成独立聚类。HV组富集双歧杆菌属（Bifidobacterium spp.）和拟杆菌属（Bacteroides spp.），而癌症患者中肠梭菌属（Enterocloster spp.）和小韦荣氏球菌（Veillonella parvula）过度代表。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fa312f25ce9477605951cb39",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "ICI响应者 (R) vs. 非响应者 (NR)",
            "finding": "在非响应者中，Enterocloster属物种、Hungatella hathewayi和Cutibacterium acnes显著富集；而在响应者中，拟杆菌属（Bacteroides spp.）占主导地位。值得注意的是，在使用Benjamini-Hochberg方法校正p值后，部分差异不再显著。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::22d712b8e9e9bd60ef353f51",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "培养组学 vs. 宏基因组测序 (NSCLC亚组)",
            "finding": "宏基因组测序识别出的物种总数多于培养组学，但两者存在显著重叠。在培养组学鉴定的154个物种中，有61个（39%）也被宏基因组检测到，而94个物种仅由培养组学发现，突显了培养组学在检测低丰度或难培养物种方面的互补价值。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cb097ca6db878d31ac3e207f",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a906be3054c8959c5a03e4d7",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "现有的宏基因组测序技术在生物信息处理复杂性、阳性检测阈值要求以及无法检测活体生物等方面存在局限，阻碍了对肠道微生物组的完全表征。本研究试图解决如何通过整合培养组学和宏基因组测序来更稳健地定位微生物组作为ICI疗效生物标志物的问题，并探索癌症相关菌群失调及与治疗响应的关联。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bee4a1228e564c7b3d38e76a",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）和皮肤黑色素瘤患者，以及健康志愿者。研究情境涉及加拿大和英国的两个学术中心，样本包括22名癌症患者和7名健康对照。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0a9c1a13d27f322f57e4af6b",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在通过结合高通量培养组学（culturomics）和宏基因组测序，全面表征接受ICI治疗的癌症患者的肠道微生物组，以克服单一技术的局限性。研究对22名癌症患者和7名健康志愿者的粪便样本进行了培养分离和宏基因组分析。结果显示，健康志愿者的物种丰富度显著高于癌症患者，且两组在β多样性上存在显著差异。在临床结果方面，非响应者中富集了Enterocloster属、Hungatella hathewayi和Cutibacterium acnes，而响应者中则主要富集Bacteroides属。此外，宏基因组测序在NSCLC患者中识别出94种仅由培养组学检测到的独特物种，证实了两种方法的互补性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ff6d3e47c045447f4bd75832",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "论文展示了培养组学与宏基因组测序在物种检出上的重叠与差异，指出宏基因组可能遗漏94种仅由培养组学发现的物种。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2c54a33740e7dedb9f378026",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "论文引言部分回顾了预临床模型（无菌小鼠、抗生素处理）和大型荟萃分析中关于肠道微生物组与ICI疗效关联的证据。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a0dc85abe92182c72570f407",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "样本量小，且健康对照组年龄较轻，可能存在年龄混杂因素。结果主要基于观察性关联，未证明因果关系。",
            "contribution": "提供了接受ICI治疗的NSCLC和黑色素瘤患者与健康志愿者之间肠道微生物组成的具体差异数据。显示癌症患者物种丰富度降低，且特定菌属（如Enterocloster, Veillonella）在癌症中富集，而有益菌（如Bifidobacterium, Bacteroides）在健康人中富集。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ba6d102058ac96ac3a60ccd3",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "统计显著性在校正后减弱。不同癌症类型（NSCLC vs Melanoma）的结果合并分析，可能掩盖亚型特异性。需结合其他研究综合评估这些标志物的普适性。",
            "contribution": "识别了与ICI治疗响应相关的特定细菌物种。响应者富集Bacteroides spp.，而非响应者富集Enterocloster spp., Hungatella hathewayi, Cutibacterium acnes。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::840d8841ea6e1ad6220e22bf"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0367"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c3980550b952c2ce2ae970e2",
          "source_handle": "P0367",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是作者基于文献的推测性讨论，本研究本身未进行功能验证实验。机制链条尚不完整，属于待检验假说。",
            "contribution": "讨论了潜在的免疫调节机制，如免疫抑制性细菌（Enterocloster等）可能通过产生免疫抑制代谢物、促进调节性T细胞分化及影响MAdCAM-1表达来削弱抗肿瘤免疫反应。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
