        {
          "atom_id": "atom::87fbbb61dc2c0edaa5061341",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "作为一篇综述，本文采用主题综合的方法，而非系统性的文献检索流程。作者选取了五个具有代表性的研究领域（癌症免疫治疗、食品乳化剂、IBD患者队列、可溶性纤维补充、人群血糖反应），分别阐述其中微生物群如何影响干预效果。通过对比不同研究中关于特定细菌与临床结局关联的异质性，以及展示微生物群介导的饮食效应（如乳化剂诱导的炎症、纤维诱导的肝癌或缓解结肠炎），构建“抗性/易感”概念框架，进而评估个性化干预的现状与前景。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6e9e45e9a3ffa6a4e686f161",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提出了“抗性”与“易感”微生物群的概念框架，强调个体间微生物群差异是解释饮食和药物干预结果异质性的关键因素。",
            "limits": "文章未提供新的实验数据，而是对现有文献的综合评述；对于如何标准化定义“抗性”和“易感”状态，以及具体的临床实施路径，尚缺乏统一标准。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::14cff54e09e9534717ce9940",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "指出了当前微生物群研究在方法学上的局限，如测序平台和分析工作流的不统一，以及物种水平分析的不足，呼吁向宏基因组和宏转录组层面发展。",
            "limits": "未能详细比较不同测序技术的具体优劣，也未提供具体的技术操作指南。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::db7920471cda288170f1db00",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "强调了非微生物因素（如性别、遗传、昼夜节律）对微生物群及干预效果的潜在影响，为未来研究提供了多维度的视角。",
            "limits": "对这些因素如何具体交互作用的机制探讨较为简略，主要作为未来研究方向提出。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::de133c33149b49c1c784eb79",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "癌症免疫治疗（抗PD-1疗法）",
            "finding": "肠道微生物群组成可预测免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效；响应者中Faecalibacterium属丰度较高，非响应者中Bacteroidales目丰度较高；Akkermansia muciniphila的丰度与临床反应相关，且补充该菌可恢复小鼠模型中的治疗 efficacy。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cf7780ad4ecf33898bebec6b",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "饮食乳化剂（CMC和P80）摄入",
            "finding": "乳化剂改变微生物群组成，促进微生物侵入粘液层，引发低度肠道炎症和代谢紊乱；这种有害效应依赖于复杂的微生物群，且在缺乏微生物群的无菌小鼠中不出现。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f9f1ee51c96cee6ae31e3533",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "麦芽糊精摄入与克罗恩病（CD）",
            "finding": "麦芽糊精增强CD相关粘附侵袭性大肠杆菌（AIEC）的生物膜形成；由于仅30%-40%的CD患者携带AIEC，针对全人群的无麦芽糊精饮食试验可能因混杂了AIEC阴性个体而显示无效，但在AIEC阳性亚组中可能有效。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a28cf92576eebd223952fef6",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "可溶性纤维（菊粉）补充",
            "finding": "在野生型小鼠中有益，但在IL10KO基因易感小鼠中加剧结肠炎；在雄性小鼠中导致肝细胞癌（HCC），且该效应由微生物群介导，可通过抑制微生物发酵预防。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2660117baf2722ea13854afd",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "餐后血糖反应（人群研究）",
            "finding": "相同饮食引起的餐后血糖反应存在高度个体差异；整合微生物群组成的机器学习算法能准确预测个体的血糖反应，支持基于微生物群的个性化饮食推荐。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
