            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d98313016ef4abf0fb2ba063",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "在慢性炎症性疾病管理中，基于肠道微生物群组成的个性化饮食干预是否已经成熟到可以应用于临床？其科学依据、现有证据及面临的障碍是什么？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::775e297de80479c8f6a3e278",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "慢性炎症性疾病（包括炎症性肠病、结直肠癌、代谢综合征等）与肠道微生物群之间的相互作用，重点探讨基于微生物群组成的个性化饮食干预的可行性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e9df2c6b2f020f9468f10f72",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在回答“我们是否准备好使用基于肠道微生物群组成的个性化饮食干预来治疗慢性炎症性疾病？”这一问题。文章首先概述了非遗传因素（如饮食成分）对肠道微生物群及宿主炎症的影响，随后通过癌症免疫治疗、乳化剂研究、患者队列研究、可溶性纤维研究以及人群基础研究的案例，论证了个体间微生物群差异对干预结果的决定性作用。作者指出，尽管目前已有证据表明微生物群可以预测药物疗效和饮食反应，但由于细菌物种关联的不一致性、检测方法的局限性以及机制的复杂性，完全个性化的临床实施仍面临挑战。文章建议将粪便采样纳入常规临床试验，并探索更精细的微生物分析手段以识别“抗性”和“易感”个体。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7239e636c35d0ccf8dfdf308",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些发现来自黑色素瘤研究，且不同研究间存在细菌物种关联的不一致性，需谨慎外推至其他实体瘤类型。",
            "contribution": "提供了癌症免疫治疗中微生物群预测疗效的直接证据：Gopalakrishnan等发现响应者富集Faecalibacterium，非响应者富集Bacteroidales；Routy等发现Akkermansia muciniphila与响应相关，且补充该菌可恢复疗效。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2603601f994fa56e8980351a",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "文章未深入阐述具体的分子机制，仅指出微生物群的中心作用，具体通路需参考其他专门研究机制的论文。",
            "contribution": "提示了微生物群可能通过影响宿主免疫状态或药物代谢来调节疗效的机制线索：例如Akkermiasia muciniphila的补充恢复了PD-1阻断的疗效，暗示微生物群可能通过调节局部或全身免疫环境发挥作用。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7433488fa448a7e804425140",
          "source_handle": "P0375",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是从饮食干预研究中推导出的方法论建议，并非直接针对ICIs试验的设计规范。",
            "contribution": "提供了关于临床试验设计的重要启示：由于个体间微生物群差异巨大，基于群体的平均结果可能掩盖亚组的显著疗效，因此需要考虑基于微生物群的 stratification。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0375"
        },
        {
