        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cdde249c42232941461dcc1b",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "1. 数据收集与预处理：从NCBI数据库获取10个队列的宏基因组原始数据，进行质控、宿主DNA去除、标准化测序深度（rarefaction至915,968 reads）及物种丰度估算（Kraken2/Bracken）。2. 多界聚类分析：对各微生物域的相对丰数据进行Hellinger转换，计算Bray-Curtis距离矩阵并转换为相似性矩阵，赋予权重后使用WSNF算法进行样本聚类，通过轮廓系数确定最佳聚类数（分为C1和C2两个亚型）。3. 多样性与临床关联分析：使用Shannon和Observed species指数评估Alpha多样性，PCoA和PERMANOVA评估Beta多样性；结合Kaplan-Meier生存分析和卡方检验分析亚型与治疗反应（Responder/Non-Responder）、无进展生存期（PFS）及总生存期（OS）的关系。4. 差异物种鉴定与建模：在训练集（70%样本）中使用DESeq2进行跨亚型差异分析，设定阈值筛选显著差异属，构建包含32个属的多界诊断模型。5. 机器学习验证：在独立测试集（30%样本）中应用随机森林和支持向量机算法，比较多界模型与单界模型的分类性能（ROC曲线/AUC）。6. 共现网络分析：使用FastSpar工具计算SparCC相关性，构建微生物共现网络，分析节点连接度和核心菌属。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4a69a10345a76a98915cbb41",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了首个基于大规模多队列整合的多界微生物组（细菌+真菌+古菌+病毒）ICI疗效预测模型，证实多界联合特征比单一细菌特征具有更高的预测精度。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的外部验证队列细节（仅提及内部70/30划分）；未提供因果机制的实验验证，仅为观察性关联；不同癌症类型和治疗方案（如抗PD-1 vs 联合疗法）的异质性处理情况未详细展开。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8918afe1508b3458874df843",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "揭示了高微生物多样性和稳定网络结构与良好ICI预后之间的关联，提出了“多界生态稳定性”作为疗效预测的新视角。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代网络分析是否控制了混杂因素（如抗生素使用、饮食等）；具体微生物介导免疫调节的分子机制仍属于推测，需后续实验验证。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::73f680b2cb25ce015b0c928d",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "识别了跨界的潜在生物标志物组合（如Bacteroides与Kluyveromyces的组合），为个性化微生态干预提供了候选靶点。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代这些标志物在不同种族、地理区域人群中的普适性验证结果；部分低丰度微生物界（如病毒、古菌）的信号可能受测序深度和技术偏差影响。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a06d831e0fc3bfa9575865c1",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "基于WSNF聚类的两个亚型（C1 vs C2），涉及965例多癌种ICI治疗患者",
            "finding": "C2亚型表现出显著更高的Alpha多样性（Shannon和Observed species指数）和更复杂的Beta多样性结构；C2亚型中响应者比例更高，且总体生存期（OS）和无进展生存期（PFS > 6个月）显著优于C1亚型。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0c84a99ade10a4cb256364e9",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "多界微生物组成差异分析",
            "finding": "C2亚型富集有益菌属，如细菌界的Bacteroides、Parabacteroides，真菌界的Kluyveromyces；C1亚型富集潜在有害菌属，如Malassezia。古菌和病毒界也显示出显著的亚型特异性分布。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dfcab8dadc4c8affa27f2f3c",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "机器学习模型预测效能比较",
            "finding": "由32个多界微生物属组成的诊断模型在区分ICI疗效方面表现出优于单一细菌、真菌、古菌或病毒模型的预测准确性（更高的AUC值）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::898f31aa8ea8f4c61c221c71",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "微生物共现网络分析",
            "finding": "C2亚型的微生物共现网络更为密集和稳健，强正相关连接（|ρ| > 0.5）的数量显著多于C1亚型；拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）在C2中为核心枢纽菌属，而Komagataella在C1中更具中心性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1c55a5039601bdb08ac540ee",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d0255eff72f4dc2d4be6accd",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "既往关于肠道微生物组与ICI疗效的研究主要局限于细菌领域，忽略了真菌、古菌和病毒等其他微生物界的作用。本研究试图解决以下问题：1. 多界微生物组的整体特征是否存在特定的分型模式？2. 这些多界微生物特征是否能比单一细菌特征更准确地预测ICI治疗的疗效？3. 不同微生物界之间的相互作用网络如何影响治疗效果？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b6953e0d3a8043bde691d4de",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "该研究针对接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的多种实体瘤患者，研究对象为肠道多界微生物组（包括细菌、真菌、古菌和病毒）。数据来源于全球7个国家的10个队列，共1712名患者的粪便宏基因组测序数据。最终纳入分析的有效样本为965例，涵盖黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、胃肠道肿瘤和肾细胞癌等。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::48ac19000f258425abe5e365",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在评估多界微生物组及其相互作用对ICI治疗疗效的预测价值。作者整合了来自多个队列的大规模宏基因组数据，利用加权相似性网络融合（WSNF）方法将四种微生物域的数据整合并进行聚类，识别出两种患者亚型（C1和C2）。研究发现，C2亚型具有更高的微生物多样性、更稳定的共现网络结构，且与更好的ICI治疗反应和预后显著相关。通过差异分析和机器学习模型，作者筛选出包含32个属的多界微生物特征组合，其预测ICI疗效的准确性优于单一界别的模型。此外，研究还揭示了特定有益菌属（如拟杆菌属、克鲁维酵母属）和潜在有害菌属（如马拉色菌属）在不同亚型中的分布差异及其与免疫调节机制的关联。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2b97608fb6d4f94f1b9a33c2",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "该结论基于回顾性队列数据的观察性关联，不能直接推断因果关系；不同癌症类型和治疗方案的混合可能引入异质性，需谨慎外推至特定单一癌种或特定药物类别。",
            "contribution": "提供了多界微生物组特征（特别是高多样性和特定属的组合）与ICI疗效正相关的实证证据。指出C2亚型（高多样性、富含Bacteroides/Kluyveromyces）与更好的治疗反应和生存率相关，而C1亚型（低多样性、富含Malassezia）与较差预后相关。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::83561df9577bb9b3b630c124",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "所给材料未提供直接的机制实验数据（如动物模型或体外细胞实验），所有机制解释均为基于文献的推测和关联分析，属于理论假说层面，需注明其为作者的解释而非已验证的因果链条。",
            "contribution": "提出了多界微生物通过维持肠道生态稳定性和产生免疫调节代谢物（如短链脂肪酸）来增强抗肿瘤免疫的潜在机制假设。讨论了Bacteroides fragilis诱导树突状细胞成熟和Th1细胞浸润，以及Malassezia激活补体级联反应导致免疫抑制的可能路径。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::78c0836b9a8d3729c6bb23ea",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "使用了WSNF方法整合多界宏基因组数据，并通过机器学习（随机森林/SVM）构建预测模型。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3124b140ef48214b18522c42",
          "source_handle": "P0393",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "讨论了抗生素使用对微生物多样性的负面影响，以及粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌（Clostridium butyricum）和益生元（inulin-type fructans）在改善ICI疗效中的潜在应用。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3cdad2d48d4bf97ae9b84052"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0393"
        },
        {
