          "value": {
            "conditions": "宏基因组与宏转录组联合分析（n=17子集）",
            "finding": "识别出与PFS相关且具有显著转录表达的宏基因组通路：风险相关通路包括L-鼠李糖降解、鸟苷核苷酸生物合成、B族维生素（泛酸、吡哆醛-5-磷酸、黄素、叶酸前体）生物合成；保护相关通路包括L-异亮氨酸生物合成。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9e353b4848cda9d7ba50ea4c",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0aeee4fa349ad6804e7718af",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "既往关于肠道微生物影响免疫治疗的研究结果不一致，且多数仅关注物种丰度而未考虑功能表达，也未充分利用时间-事件数据（常二分化患者为响应者/非响应者）。本研究试图通过整合16S、宏基因组和宏转录组数据，更精确地鉴定与无进展生存期相关的特定微生物类群和功能通路，并探索其潜在的机制联系。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::29a4f46df8425be012292ee7",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "27例接受免疫治疗（抗PD-1或抗CTLA-4）的转移性或辅助性黑色素瘤患者；研究基于治疗前粪便样本，采用16S rRNA基因测序、鸟枪法宏基因组测序及子集（n=17）的宏转录组测序；主要终点为无进展生存期（PFS）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9a77bfdf071594bc0086aebd",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在探究肠道微生物群对黑色素瘤免疫治疗疗效的影响。通过对27名患者的治疗前粪便样本进行多组学分析，研究发现较高的微生物群落丰富度与较长的无进展生存期相关。基于整体微生物组成的聚类分析将患者分为高、中、低风险组，其中低风险组的疾病进展风险显著低于高风险组。在物种层面，拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）中的部分菌种（如B. ovatus, B. dorei）与较短的PFS相关，而粪杆菌属（Faecalibacterium）中的F. prausnitzii等则与较长的PFS相关。此外，研究首次结合宏转录组数据，识别出与PFS相关的宏基因组功能通路及其转录表达，包括L-鼠李糖降解、鸟苷核苷酸生物合成和B族维生素生物合成等风险相关通路，以及异亮氨酸生物合成等保护相关通路。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::00b11793deff66a1d919563f",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限黑色素瘤患者；样本量小；未区分不同免疫药物类型的差异；关联而非因果。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组成（丰富度、聚类分组）和特定物种丰度与免疫治疗疗效（PFS）正负向关联的具体数据。证实了较高丰富度和特定保护性菌种（如F. prausnitzii）与更好预后相关，而特定风险菌种（如B. ovatus）与较差预后相关。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::871f50f4dcbe93707acc51ed",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制仅为推测，基于相关性分析；宏转录组样本量有限（n=17），统计效力不足；无法直接证明这些通路在体内确实导致了免疫调节；所给摘要未交代具体的代谢物浓度测量或动物实验验证。",
            "contribution": "提供了潜在的机制线索：识别出与PFS相关的宏基因组功能通路及其转录表达。具体包括：风险通路（L-鼠李糖降解、鸟苷核苷酸合成、B族维生素合成）和保护通路（L-异亮氨酸合成）。作者推测这些代谢产物可能通过影响T细胞功能或肿瘤微环境来调节疗效。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ff44063c2bde32931bb20b1a",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "论文讨论了既往研究（Gopalakrishnan et al., Matson et al.等）在物种发现上的不一致性，并指出功能冗余可能是关键决定因素的观点。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::345c79f514e73c54a4e5a1ce",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "使用了16S、宏基因组和宏转录组的多组学整合策略，以及500×10折交叉验证的弹性网络Cox回归进行特征选择。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::eb725823ea2bd9cc8e0f9c70",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究仅在黑色素瘤中进行，结论不能直接外推至其他固体肿瘤，尽管综述主题包含所有固体肿瘤。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0415"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a49e41e5085e72c62aeb151e",
          "source_handle": "P0415",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "宏转录组数据仅来自17名患者，因此关于转录表达与预后的关联应被视为初步探索性结果，统计效力受限。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
