          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9fccf1f92e02624214751276",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7d394b023c0e359555818e62",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管前体模型显示肠道微生物组显著影响ICI疗效，但在临床实践中这种相互作用尚不清楚。本研究试图确定：(1)抗生素是否影响ICI疗效；(2)基线微生物组组成是否与ICI疗效相关；(3)基线微生物组组成是否与irAEs发生相关；(4)微生物组操纵是否能减轻irAEs。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::36d86217c97658464f951139",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "人类实体瘤患者（主要为非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、黑色素瘤等）接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括抗CTLA-4、抗PD-1和抗PD-L1抗体）治疗期间，肠道微生物组（GM）及其修饰（如抗生素使用、粪便微生物群移植FMT）对ICI疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::43d061a73b3a3eae2757344b",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "这是一篇2019年发表的系统综述，旨在评估临床实践中肠道微生物组与免疫检查点抑制剂疗效之间的关联。作者通过Medline检索，筛选出13项符合纳入标准的人类研究（包括全文文章和摘要），分别分析了抗生素使用对ICI疗效的影响、基线微生物组组成与ICI疗效的相关性、以及微生物组组成与irAEs（特别是结肠炎）的相关性。研究发现抗生素使用普遍与ICI疗效降低相关，而特定的微生物组成或多样性与更好的临床结局有关；此外，FMT在个别案例中显示出缓解ICI诱导的结肠炎的潜力。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8110bf0dfeccd06b176b388b",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "综述结论建议尽可能避免在ICI治疗前或使用期间使用抗生素，因为其对ICI抗癌疗效有负面影响。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1ec1d115dbdccbaa73d52394",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "FMT在动物模型中恢复ICI疗效并减少结肠炎，在人类个案中成功缓解难治性结肠炎，但尚无改善ICI疗效的人体数据。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::adfa7bd48f577f29787929e6",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "口腔微生物组与ICI疗效无明显关联，而肠道微生物组有显著关联。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::87be9dc5c374268b1a03bb40",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "相关性不等于因果性；具体菌种的预测价值在不同研究中存在冲突，不能直接确立单一通用生物标志物。样本量较小，多为回顾性研究。",
            "contribution": "提供了抗生素使用与ICI疗效降低之间关联的多项临床研究汇总，包括ORR、PFS和OS的具体变化趋势。同时列举了不同癌症类型中微生物组组成与疗效关联的具体菌种（如Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium等），尽管这些菌种在不同研究中不一致。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d5efbdf228428548df85d84f",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些主要是基于动物模型或观察性数据的推测，文中明确指出人类患者中尚未进行类似的机制验证研究。无法直接证明具体的分子机制路径。",
            "contribution": "讨论了抗生素可能通过改变微生物组选择不利菌种、或通过抗生素本身的抗炎特性（如降低促炎细胞因子、减少T细胞反应）来拮抗ICI疗效的潜在机制。指出微生物组与irAEs（结肠炎）的关联可能反映了ICI疗效与免疫介导毒性之间的正相关（表型伴随现象）。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::404a9ca12df1963abbc87e35",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述主要涵盖实体瘤，特别是NSCLC、RCC和黑色素瘤，结果可能不适用于血液肿瘤或其他类型癌症。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::53a0bd3fb171b371a2478ce7",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "关于特定细菌物种与疗效的关联在不同研究中存在不一致，这可能与检测方法、人群特征和医疗史差异有关，需谨慎解读单一菌种的预测价值。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8297157472470af83f1bc39c",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "抗生素的影响可能是多方面的（微生物组改变+直接抗炎作用），综述未区分具体抗生素种类的影响差异，仅指出广谱抗生素影响更显著。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3",
            "snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f",
            "snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch5",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_005\\c8a8e196a35945b70bab58ac7d25825d55761abfe16e04e3930ca8753de1bb61\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0417"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5d67a3c8f18f37b7d08c0079",
          "source_handle": "P0417",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "FMT在缓解irAEs中的效果仅基于个案报告，不能推广为常规治疗建议。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
