          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0433"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c3e678fb3ea2081e63b354fd",
          "source_handle": "P0433",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述涵盖多种实体瘤，但不同癌症类型中微生物群的作用可能截然不同（如Akkermansia在NSCLC/RCC中有益，但在其他癌症中不一致），使用时需注意癌症类型的特异性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0433"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d2360beb5d7ef22710f37801",
          "source_handle": "P0433",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "文中提到的许多机制证据来自小鼠模型，直接外推到人类需谨慎，尤其是涉及复杂的人体免疫系统和微生物群落结构时。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0433"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::50359ff5e38cdcbacfb28b5a",
          "source_handle": "P0433",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "临床观察性研究中的关联不等于因果，特别是对于代谢物水平与疗效的关系，可能存在反向因果或混杂因素（如饮食、药物）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0433"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4615d5edd36a172156421c14",
          "source_handle": "P0433",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "FMT和益生菌的效果在不同研究中差异巨大，部分源于产品标准化不足和患者基线状态差异，不能一概而论地认为所有微生物干预都有效。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0433"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c28946c806a4057bba9aea36",
          "source_handle": "P0433",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "抗生素暴露对ICI疗效的负面影响在多队列中得到一致报道，但具体影响的微生物机制仍需进一步阐明。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0433"
        },
