            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "研究设计采用多队列回顾性数据分析路线。首先，对来自四个独立研究的347个粪便样本进行宏基因组测序数据的预处理（质控、去宿主DNA）。其次，构建自定义参考基因组集：从Ashray_2024队列中提取contigs，生成两类参考集——用于提取生物先验知识的“Top 1”最长contig集（1269个）和用于计算基因丰度的“Top 200”最长contig集（161,107个）。接着，使用CoverM计算每个样本相对于自定义参考集的RPKM基因水平丰度矩阵；同时使用ESM-2模型将“Top 1”contigs的蛋白序列编码为320维嵌入向量作为生物先验知识。最后，构建变分自编码器（VAE）架构的BioP-VAE模型，通过注意力机制融合生物先验知识与RPKM特征，进行ICI反应和二分类预测。评估指标包括AUC、AUPR和准确率，并使用集成梯度（IG）方法进行特征归因分析。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::97cf36ede5ecfff3824fd105",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提出了BioP-VAE模型，证明基因水平微生物丰度结合生物先验知识在预测ICI反应方面优于传统的分类学特征，特别是在CICB治疗背景下具有跨癌种泛化潜力。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的统计检验细节（如多重比较校正）。跨队列泛化能力受限于治疗策略（CICB vs 单药）和队列间的异质性，模型在单药治疗间的泛化效果不佳。未包含真菌、病毒等非细菌微生物组数据，也未整合宿主多维生物学信息（如肿瘤突变负荷、免疫微环境）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a91acbcf0d7d10e3af6178ee",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "Ashray_2024队列（CICB治疗，罕见实体瘤）内部验证",
            "finding": "整合生物先验知识的过滤后RPKM特征在预测ICI反应中表现最佳，平均AUC为0.89，准确率为92.68%，显著优于所有层级的分类学丰度特征（最高AUC 0.72）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e1c25a7f5e0305dddaab98ac",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "跨队列评估（训练集与测试集分离）",
            "finding": "在CICB治疗背景下，模型展现出一定的跨队列泛化能力（Ashray_2024训练，Frankel_2017 CICB子集测试，AUC=0.88）。但在单药治疗队列（Lee_2022, Matson_2018）之间或向单药子集的泛化能力较差（AUC < 0.60-0.64）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9804a41fd821fa289bc29c6a",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "单药治疗队列内部验证",
            "finding": "在抗PD-1/CTLA-4单药治疗的内部队列中，BioP-VAE实现了极高的预测性能，平均AUC达到0.97。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0982efcdb938bbab4f561a53",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "12个月无进展生存期（PFS）预测",
            "finding": "在Ashray_2024队列中，整合生物先验知识的RPKM特征预测12个月PFS的AUC为0.88，优于仅使用临床因素或传统分类学特征。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::24da6e6e61b40253d81d17e4",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "年龄分层分析（>60岁 vs ≤60岁）",
            "finding": "年轻患者的预测性能略高于老年患者（AUC 0.91 vs 0.87）。归因分析显示不同年龄组的贡献微生物存在差异：老年响应者中Bifidobacterium属贡献为正，而年轻响应者中UBA11524等未培养属贡献显著；非响应者中两组的特征分布也截然不同。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::15373772af35e0f7f7f6cffa",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::708c6dc34b637e9b959cfda5",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "现有的基于参考基因组数据库的分类学丰度方法限制了未表征微生物的发现和功能解释，且缺乏跨队列和癌症类型的高分辨率、可泛化的预测生物标志物。如何构建更有效的预测模型以区分ICI治疗响应者与非响应者？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7d5ad378e6d7f1a02700fe10",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的实体瘤患者，涵盖黑色素瘤及多种罕见实体瘤。情境包括不同地理区域、不同治疗策略（联合免疫检查点阻断 CICB 与单药治疗）以及不同年龄层（>60岁与≤60岁）。范围聚焦于利用粪便宏基因组数据预测治疗反应和12个月无进展生存期（PFS）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::74f62456da230e452dce8a66",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在解决现有ICI疗效预测生物标志物依赖分类学丰度、难以捕捉未表征微生物功能异质性的问题。作者整合了四个公开可用的粪便宏基因组队列（Ashray_2024, Lee_2022, Matson_2018, Frankel_2017），开发了一种名为BioP-VAE的深度学习模型。该模型以基因水平微生物丰度（RPKM特征）为输入，并引入基于蛋白质序列嵌入的生物先验知识。研究比较了基因水平特征与传统分类学特征在预测ICI反应及12个月PFS中的性能，并通过特征归因分析和年龄分层分析揭示了关键微生物基因及其潜在的生物学机制。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::65503468d23f0b34c349344a",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "结果主要基于Ashray_2024（罕见实体瘤+CICB）和黑色素瘤队列。跨队列泛化仅在CICB背景下成立，单药背景下的泛化性差，因此不能推广为通用的单一微生物标志物。",
            "contribution": "提供了基因水平微生物丰度作为预测生物标志物的实证数据，证明其在CICB治疗下优于分类学特征。具体识别出在响应者中富集的Rikenellaceae, Ruminococcaceae, Lachnospiraceae家族，以及在非响应者中富集的Desulfovibrionaceae, Bacteroidaceae家族。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::aa57ec061e37cb85469a506b",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些是相关性分析（特征归因后的富集），并非因果实验验证。机制解释依赖于作者的理论推导，需注明为假设性关联。",
            "contribution": "通过KEGG和GO富集分析揭示了潜在机制：响应者中富集的nitrilase基因参与氮代谢和T细胞调节；非响应者中富集的lipoic acid metabolism可能通过调节氧化应激影响免疫。年龄分层显示老年响应者与Bifidobacterium相关，年轻响应者与UBA11524等相关。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1c7a36b342d7405117ddef9e",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "BioP-VAE模型架构，整合蛋白序列嵌入（ESM-2）与宏基因组RPKM特征，使用集成梯度进行可解释性分析。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dcdc4ba1b0aa608551e38585",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "跨队列验证结果显示，基于CICB训练的模型在单药测试中失效，反之亦然；不同年龄组的关键预测菌属不同。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0437"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cfb9a770641f543a9e72f1b5",
          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究的泛化性结论严格限定在治疗策略上：CICB背景下的基因特征具有跨癌种一致性，但单药背景下的特征不具备同等泛化性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
