          "source_handle": "P0437",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "‘基因水平优于分类学水平’的结论基于特定自定义参考基因组集，其他研究使用的标准数据库可能得出不同结果。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::632dbc6fb80b78c563de25fc"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
