        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::82c1049c351f6660caa30818",
          "source_handle": "P0439",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "解决ICIs在大多数结直肠癌患者（尤其是MSS/pMMR型）中疗效有限的问题，探索如何通过调节肠道微生物组来克服免疫治疗耐药性，并识别相关的安全隐患。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0439"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::edd6329a6caa52f247dce0af",
          "source_handle": "P0439",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "结直肠癌（CRC）患者，特别是微卫星稳定/错配修复 proficient (MSS/pMMR) 亚型；聚焦肠道微生物组对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的影响及基于微生物组的干预策略。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0439"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3e4a05237cb42d6954c814b0",
          "source_handle": "P0439",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "这是一篇叙事性综述，旨在总结肠道微生物组在结直肠癌发生、发展及免疫治疗反应中的作用机制，并评估益生菌、粪菌移植（FMT）、饮食调节和传统药物等微生物组干预措施作为ICIs辅助治疗的潜力与安全性。文章指出，尽管微生物组调控在临床前模型中显示出增强抗肿瘤免疫的潜力，但现有证据存在不一致性且缺乏大规模临床试验支持，因此强调需要标准化的方法和更严谨的临床验证。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0439"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ebd11b917309870a1c077e6e",
          "source_handle": "P0439",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "证据主要来自小鼠模型和小规模人类研究，缺乏大规模随机对照试验的直接因果证明；不同研究间结果存在冲突（如A. muciniphila）。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组影响ICIs疗效的具体微生物物种（如Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium, Lactobacillus, Fusobacterium）及其在MSS/pMMR CRC中的临床前和初步临床证据。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0439"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5a7b7c989be4d1458c33014d",
          "source_handle": "P0439",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "多数机制细节源自动物模型或体外实验，在人体内的确切适用性需结合具体临床数据验证；不同机制可能在不同患者亚群中主导作用不同。",
            "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物组调节免疫反应的机制，包括：1) 代谢物介导（SCFAs, 4-HPA, 胆汁酸）；2) 免疫细胞招募与极化（CD8+ T cells, DCs, M1/M2 macrophages）；3) 炎症通路激活（TLR4, NF-κB）；4) 屏障功能维持。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
