          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::87c618ccb626b5ac1e61c84b",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "material_status"
          ],
          "value": "resolved",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d3acce1d97406cdc7f871998",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "1. 数据收集：纳入连续确诊的晚期NSCLC患者，收集基线粪便样本（ICI治疗前或首次给药后7天内），记录临床病理参数（PFS、PD-L1 IHC评分、化疗史、合并用药等）。2. 测序与分析：进行鸟枪法宏基因组测序，使用Kraken2进行物种注释，排除病毒和真核生物，仅保留细菌和古菌。3. 统计分析：使用Shannon指数评估α-多样性；使用UMAP和PERMANOVA评估β-多样性；使用Wilcoxon秩和检验进行差异丰度分析；构建Spearman相关性网络分析菌群互作。4. 预测建模：应用Lasso回归进行特征选择以规避过拟合，使用多变量Cox回归评估独立预测因子，并通过Kaplan-Meier曲线和Log-rank检验验证生存差异。5. 机器学习：构建随机森林模型，通过5折交叉验证评估基于分类学（物种）和代谢通路（MetaCyc数据库）的特征对PFS和PD-L1状态的预测性能（AUC值）。6. 验证：在独立的验证队列（n=60）中复现关键物种的预测价值。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fb59ad4bec4a4e24b5df0d65",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "在高加索NSCLC人群中，首次在物种水平上确认了*Alistipes*属（*A. shahii*, *A. finegoldii*）与长PFS的正向关联，以及*Streptococcus*属（*S. salivarius*, *S. vestibularis*）和*Bifidobacterium breve*与短PFS的负向关联，并在独立队列中进行了验证。",
            "limits": "研究为横断面观察性设计，无法确定菌群改变是疾病/治疗的结果还是原因。样本量相对较小（发现队列62人），且主要局限于高加索人群，外推至其他种族需谨慎。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cdddca4347767666e81d60f7",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "揭示了肠道微生物组网络拓扑结构的差异：长PFS患者的菌群网络具有更高的连通性和中心性，提示有益菌之间的协同作用可能有助于维持免疫治疗响应。",
            "limits": "网络分析基于相关性，不能直接证明因果机制。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ded295799b0c5ea10e07292f",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "区分了分类学特征与代谢功能在预测不同终点上的优势：分类学用于预测PFS，代谢通路用于预测PD-L1状态，为多维生物标志物开发提供了依据。",
            "limits": "代谢通路分析仅在37名患者的子集中进行，代表性可能受限。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f58a8e7c12ac2643ae1a6e90",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "澄清了α-多样性在ICI疗效预测中的局限性，指出其在本研究中与PFS无关，强调了特定物种丰度和β-多样性的重要性。",
            "limits": "与其他研究（如东亚人群）结果存在差异，部分源于种族背景、测序方法（16S vs 宏基因组）和参考数据库的不同。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8854143fc8da7a3753da0fd9",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "所有比较组（长/短PFS、PD-L1高低、化疗处理/未处理）",
            "finding": "α-多样性（Shannon指数）在各组间均无显著差异。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dca365e90a5ce019eb2b0ecd",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "长PFS（>6个月） vs. 短PFS（≤6个月）",
            "finding": "β-多样性存在显著差异。短PFS患者中厚壁菌门（Firmicutes）和放线菌门（Actinobacteria）丰度显著增加，F/B比率升高。长PFS患者中*Alistipes shahii*、*Alistipes finegoldii*和*Barnesiella visceriola*丰度较高；短PFS患者中*Streptococcus salivarius*、*S. vestibularis*和*Bifidobacterium breve*丰度较高。长PFS患者的菌群网络连接更紧密，具有更高的中心性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
