          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1b9db5e9fba19073e07da37a",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管抗PD-1免疫治疗在部分NSCLC患者中有效，但总体响应率较低且个体差异大。现有的PD-L1生物标志物存在局限性（如超过50%的高表达患者不响应）。因此，亟需发现能够更准确预测免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的创新性生物标志物，特别是探究肠道微生物组是否以及如何影响ICI疗效。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bf381632e4e9954b4da9150d",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为62名接受抗PD-1免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者（发现队列），以及60名来自同一机构、接受相同治疗指南的验证队列患者。研究情境聚焦于高加索人群，分析基线粪便样本中的肠道微生物组特征，并评估其与无进展生存期（PFS）、PD-L1表达状态、化疗预处理历史及药物使用（抗生素、抗酸药、类固醇）的关系。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::43c8bd2245d1dd21101634ef",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在探索肠道微生物组作为预测NSCLC患者抗PD-1免疫治疗疗效的新型生物标志物的潜力。作者利用鸟枪法宏基因组测序技术，对发现队列和验证队列患者的肠道菌群进行深度分析。研究首先比较了不同临床分组间的α-多样性和β-多样性差异，随后通过单变量和多变量统计模型（Lasso回归、Cox比例风险回归）筛选与PFS相关的特异性细菌分类群和代谢通路。最后，采用随机森林机器学习算法评估分类学特征和代谢通路在预测PFS和PD-L1表达中的效能。研究确认了特定菌属/种与PFS的关联，并揭示了微生物群落网络结构在治疗反应者与非反应者间的差异。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f4dbf3bd1ff2fc87e04d5633",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限NSCLC患者，高加索人群。PFS定义为>6个月为长，≤6个月为短。未涉及总生存期（OS）。",
            "contribution": "提供了具体的细菌分类群（物种水平）与ICI疗效（PFS）的关联证据。发现*Alistipes shahii*和*A. finegoldii*丰度高与长PFS相关，而*Streptococcus salivarius*、*S. vestibularis*和*B. breve*丰度高与短PFS相关。这些发现在独立验证队列中得到确认。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::feeef6f1df4ea05728330825",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "基于随机森林模型，可能存在过拟合风险，尽管使用了交叉验证。代谢通路分析样本量较小（n=37）。",
            "contribution": "提供了微生物组特征预测效能的量化数据。分类学特征预测PFS的AUC为0.74，代谢通路预测PD-L1的AUC为0.87。同时指出α-多样性在此场景下无预测价值。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a3a5b9914305654656477c50",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅为相关性观察，未通过干预实验验证网络结构变化是否导致疗效改变。机制解释尚属推测。",
            "contribution": "提出了菌群网络结构可能与疗效相关的假设。长PFS患者表现出更密集的菌群网络和更高的节点中心性，暗示有益菌之间的协同互作可能增强抗肿瘤免疫。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dca49d80e01fef93b6041699",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "代谢通路数据仅来自子集。F/B比率的具体生物学机制未在本研究中深入阐明。",
            "contribution": "分析了代谢通路（如氨基酸合成、发酵）与PD-L1表达的联系，以及厚壁菌/拟杆菌比率（F/B ratio）与短PFS的联系。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::35103c949497a976bb9740b8",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "观察性研究，混杂因素较多。化疗方案多样，未统一标准化。",
            "contribution": "评估了化疗预处理对肠道菌群的影响。发现化疗确实改变了菌群组成（β-多样性差异），但这种改变并未将菌群推向特定的“不良预后”表型，且化疗预处理患者中仍保留了与PFS相关的特异性菌群差异。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d728198fecb8864ce25b1c18",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "引言中提到的“分子模拟”假说（微生物抗原与肿瘤新抗原相似，激活T细胞）以及“肠-肺轴”概念。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5098926836554035c3b06b7d",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "讨论部分指出本研究与东亚人群研究（Jin et al., Zhang et al.）结果的差异，归因于种族背景、测序方法（16S vs 宏基因组）和参考数据库的不同。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f539b66ea1f6e028c87c0c12",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "研究了抗生素、抗酸药（PPI）和类固醇使用对菌群的影响。发现抗酸药使用与短PFS相关菌属（链球菌）增加有关，而抗生素使用未直接关联短PFS菌属增加。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::24419f7508af418e94b98eeb",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究为观察性横断面研究，发现的菌群与PFS关联仅为统计学相关，不能直接推断因果关系。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::70e5af635ac8a33a9883b412",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "样本主要来自高加索人群，结论外推至其他种族（如亚洲、非洲）时需考虑微生物组地域差异。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::13e15e1ea0c2a87317c8c1e9",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "PFS的定义（6个月阈值）可能影响结果的解释，且未报告总生存期（OS）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0443"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::db4a1a595b125fa5470e038e",
          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "代谢通路分析仅在部分患者中进行，可能不代表整体队列的功能特征。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c318"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
