          "source_handle": "P0443",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "机器学习模型的预测性能（AUC 0.74）属于中等水平，尚未达到临床常规应用的极高精度标准。",
          "role": "evidence",
