        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bf1d46b1c9816d089c247528",
          "source_handle": "P0470",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管临床前和临床研究提示特定细菌类群可能影响ICIs的疗效和irAEs，但这些关联的幅度和一致性尚不明确。本研究旨在量化肠道微生物群组成及其调控对ICIs治疗疗效和毒性谱的具体影响。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0470"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2f51eb111c2ace15d2475862",
          "source_handle": "P0470",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "癌症患者（特别是接受免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者）的肠道微生物群组成、干预措施及其与疗效和不良事件的关系。涵盖的研究类型包括观察性研究（基线菌群、抗生素暴露）、干预性研究（FMT、益生菌/益生元）。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0470"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8bd32a4a71acaf80a8edd654",
          "source_handle": "P0470",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该论文是一篇系统综述和荟萃分析，旨在评估肠道微生物群对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。作者通过系统检索PubMed、Embase、Web of Science和Cochrane Library数据库（截至2025年3月），纳入了38项涉及5,642名患者的研究。研究重点分析了特定细菌属（如Akkermansia muciniphila、Bifidobacterium longum、Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）的富集、抗生素使用、供体反应者粪便微生物移植（FMT）以及微生物多样性指数与总生存期（OS）、无进展生存期（PFS）、客观缓解率（ORR）及irAEs之间的关联。结果显示，有益菌富集与改善生存预后显著相关，而抗生素暴露则与较差的生存结果相关，FMT从反应者来源可显著提高缓解率。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0470"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4d515e81ecce4092cc77829d",
          "source_handle": "P0470",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅展示关联，不直接提供分子机制；未区分不同肿瘤类型间的差异；未提供irAEs的具体效应量数据。",
            "contribution": "提供了特定细菌属（Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium, Faecalibacterium）富集与ICIs疗效提升（OS, PFS）的正向关联证据；提供了抗生素暴露与疗效下降的负向关联证据；提供了FMT提高ORR的证据。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0470"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6b402a143e9e52a21f1a8a4b",
          "source_handle": "P0470",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "本综述本身未深入阐述具体的分子或细胞机制（如抗原呈递、T细胞浸润等），因此不能直接用于回答机制问题，只能作为机制研究的动机或验证目标。",
            "contribution": "虽然主要关注临床结局关联，但通过指出特定菌属和多样性的作用，间接指向了可能的机制路径（如免疫激活）。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0470"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e78858b2e1123d4265b08dbb",
          "source_handle": "P0470",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "确认肠道微生物群是ICIs疗效的关键决定因素，且存在可量化的关联。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
